00:14:17,439 --> 00:14:19,483
Oh, that's a wrap for today.

245
00:14:19,567 --> 00:14:21,235
-Time to bounce.
-What?

246
00:14:21,318 --> 00:14:22,945
-Catch you guys later.
-Catch you guys later.

247
00:14:23,028 --> 00:14:24,071
No, don't leave me!

248
00:14:24,154 --> 00:14:25,656
Geek Boy!

249
00:14:26,949 --> 00:14:29,076
That's my dick!

250
00:14:29,159 --> 00:14:31,954
What even was the point
of that little cameo?

251
00:14:37,126 --> 00:14:38,836
I thought I was dead.

252
00:14:38,919 --> 00:14:40,004
<i>This is it.</i>

253
00:14:40,087 --> 00:14:44,008
<i>The power we need lies dormant here,</i>
<i>in the Chamber of Resurrection.</i>

254
00:14:44,466 --> 00:14:46,427
Power…

255
00:14:48,554 --> 00:14:50,598
Where's that dick of mine?

256
00:14:50,681 --> 00:14:53,100
-Panty, look!
-There it is.

257
00:14:53,183 --> 00:14:55,311
I made it, comrades.

258
00:14:55,394 --> 00:14:56,979
-Talking to himself again.
-It is time.

259
00:14:57,062 --> 00:14:59,898
-What's that smoke coming from his head?
-They will feel our wrath.

260
00:14:59,982 --> 00:15:02,276
Whatever, let's just get--

261
00:15:04,528 --> 00:15:05,613
What are those?

262
00:15:05,696 --> 00:15:08,824
Ew! Oh, God, scorpions! So gross!

263
00:15:08,907 --> 00:15:09,908
What the heck?

264
00:15:09,992 --> 00:15:13,203
Ugh, I hate tombs. I am so over this--

265
00:15:14,413 --> 00:15:16,415
Well, well, big boy.

266
00:15:16,498 --> 00:15:19,001
<i>Scorpions. The source of vitality.</i>

267
00:15:19,084 --> 00:15:21,712
<i>Bind to us in flesh and in blood.</i>

268
00:15:21,795 --> 00:15:24,256
<i>Gather our rage, and let it spill.</i>

269
00:15:24,340 --> 00:15:29,094
<i>Bitches! Tonight you are the ones</i>
<i>who will be devoured!</i>

270
00:15:30,220 --> 00:15:33,098
Now that I see you in your Ghost form,
you're as good as dead.

271
00:15:33,182 --> 00:15:34,183
Repent!

272
00:15:37,061 --> 00:15:38,062
<i>It is futile!</i>

273
00:15:38,145 --> 00:15:41,065
Fine. You wanna play? How about this!

274
00:15:42,733 --> 00:15:43,942
<i>Futile.</i>

275
00:15:47,780 --> 00:15:49,782
Ha. Done and dead.

276
00:15:49,865 --> 00:15:52,034
Well, that was a mess… but whatever.

277
00:15:52,117 --> 00:15:54,662
Let's just grab the Heaven Coins
and get out of here.

278
00:15:54,745 --> 00:15:57,164
<i>Hold your shticks.</i>

279
00:16:00,125 --> 00:16:03,212
Fuck! Why don't our weapons work?

280
00:16:07,049 --> 00:16:08,467
<i>I am Penis!</i>

281
00:16:08,550 --> 00:16:10,427
Jack it! Go, go!

282
00:16:10,511 --> 00:16:12,137
-Come here!
-Aah! It's gaining on us!

283
00:16:12,221 --> 00:16:13,597
Put your back into it!

284
00:16:16,809 --> 00:16:18,769
-Did we lose him?
-Think so.

285
00:16:20,562 --> 00:16:22,272
This prick's persistent!

286
00:16:26,860 --> 00:16:29,071
It's even bigger than before!

287
00:16:29,154 --> 00:16:33,409
Do you think maybe the ruins
are feeding it power through the curse?

288
00:16:33,492 --> 00:16:36,078
Maybe that's how it keeps
regenerating and getting bigger?

289
00:16:36,161 --> 00:16:37,162
Huh?

290
00:16:37,871 --> 00:16:40,791
Maybe that's why your heavenly weapons
had no effect on it.

291
00:16:41,917 --> 00:16:42,918
I see how it is.

292
00:16:43,001 --> 00:16:46,672
So if we can draw it out of the ruins…

293
00:16:46,755 --> 00:16:48,924
-Panty, look!
-I see it! Let's go!

294
00:17:04,523 --> 00:17:05,524
-Huh?
-Huh?

295
00:17:05,607 --> 00:17:08,527
Look how cute it is
now that we're out of the ruins.

296
00:17:08,610 --> 00:17:10,571
It went limp.

297
00:17:10,654 --> 00:17:13,782
Hey, little buddy, what happened?
You were so gung ho before.

298
00:17:13,866 --> 00:17:16,326
Sorry, little sausage. Repent!

299
00:17:31,008 --> 00:17:32,176
You saved me.

300
00:17:32,259 --> 00:17:34,219
Thank you, Panty.

301
00:17:34,303 --> 00:17:35,888
Geez, you are always such a handful.

302
00:17:35,971 --> 00:17:37,681
And all we get is this?

303
00:17:37,765 --> 00:17:39,975
All that effort
just for a teeny, tiny little coin.

304
00:17:40,809 --> 00:17:43,270
Well that was hardly worth
getting out of bed for.

305
00:17:43,353 --> 00:17:46,857
If we'd taken the treasure,
we could be buying sweets right now.

306
00:17:46,940 --> 00:17:50,110
Garter is so gonna get
what's coming for him when we get back.

307
00:18:00,329 --> 00:18:02,122
-<i>The Plush.</i>
-<i>The Plush.</i>

308
00:18:10,672 --> 00:18:15,552
Fuck! I ask Garter to give Honekoneko
a wash and look what happens!

309
00:18:15,636 --> 00:18:17,930
I told him it has to be hand-washed!

310
00:18:18,013 --> 00:18:22,017
I'm sorry, Honekoneko.
I'll make you better, don't worry.

311
00:18:22,100 --> 00:18:23,811
Let's see… plushies…

312
00:18:23,894 --> 00:18:25,979
How do you fix a plushie?

313
00:18:26,063 --> 00:18:27,689
Confirming Honekoneko prior to repairs.

314
00:18:27,773 --> 00:18:28,941
Who's this tool?

315
00:18:29,024 --> 00:18:32,569
I'm Agent Tom Croose Jr.
from the PreCrime Division.

316
00:18:32,653 --> 00:18:34,530
I come from the future, in 2054.

317
00:18:35,989 --> 00:18:36,990
I'm a time traveler.

318
00:18:37,074 --> 00:18:39,701
Here. Have a signed photo as a keepsake.

319
00:18:39,785 --> 00:18:40,953
Yeah, no thanks.

320
00:18:41,036 --> 00:18:43,997
This is the future
as predicted by Precogs.

321
00:18:45,916 --> 00:18:50,754
Your decision to repair your Honekoneko
now will trigger a strange turn of events.

322
00:18:50,838 --> 00:18:54,508
The Honekoneko awaken
to a new order of intelligence,

323
00:18:54,591 --> 00:18:58,262
and they command an army of plushies
to subjugate all of humanity.

324
00:18:58,345 --> 00:19:00,889
Ooh! So I'm actually a genius!

325
00:19:02,182 --> 00:19:03,433
Hey! What are you doing?

326
00:19:04,101 --> 00:19:05,310
Are you resisting?

327
00:19:05,394 --> 00:19:09,147
I must eliminate that Honekoneko
to prevent further crimes in the future!

328
00:19:09,231 --> 00:19:10,482
You're insane!

329
00:19:10,566 --> 00:19:13,485
I am a time traveler!
Heed my warning from 2054!

330
00:19:13,569 --> 00:19:15,404
Can't you go bother someone
in a different year?

331
00:19:15,487 --> 00:19:17,906
That's it. I'm making a post about this.

332
00:19:17,990 --> 00:19:19,825
Prepare to get canceled, buddy.

333
00:19:19,908 --> 00:19:21,285
Huh?

334
00:19:21,368 --> 00:19:23,704
What the hell is it now?

335
00:19:23,787 --> 00:19:27,791
I am from the year 2029.
I am the Honekonator.

336
00:19:27,875 --> 00:19:31,086
Our Honekoneko leader
in the not-too-distant future

337
00:19:31,169 --> 00:19:36,133
is almost assassinated in this era
by a troublesome time traveler.

338
00:19:36,216 --> 00:19:38,969
I saw your post,
so I traveled back in time.

339
00:19:39,052 --> 00:19:41,263
Shit! Why did I have to make
that stupid post?

340
00:19:42,806 --> 00:19:44,850
2029 is not that far off!

341
00:19:44,933 --> 00:19:49,605
I am from 2054.
I am more of a time traveler than you!

342
00:19:49,688 --> 00:19:50,689
<i>Hasta la vista</i>, baby.

343
00:19:50,772 --> 00:19:53,400
Quickly, quickly. Uh-oh!

344
00:19:53,483 --> 00:19:56,528
-Hurry up and close, doors!
-Come back, troublesome time traveler!

345
00:19:56,612 --> 00:20:00,407
You keep saying you're from the future.
What's so bad about the year 2054?

346
00:20:00,490 --> 00:20:04,703
The world is abuzz with news
of the newly-born panda twins.

347
00:20:04,786 --> 00:20:06,496
Panda twins? Sounds super wholesome.

348
00:20:08,457 --> 00:20:10,375
The year 2054 may be peaceful,

349
00:20:10,459 --> 00:20:15,130
but Precogs says Honekoneko makes it hell
on Earth for humanity in the year 3,000.

350
00:20:15,213 --> 00:20:17,382
Oh, how it makes me
toss and turn at night!

351
00:20:17,466 --> 00:20:19,426
That's why I have to kill Honekoneko!

352
00:20:19,509 --> 00:20:21,929
Die! Troublesome time traveler.

353
00:20:22,012 --> 00:20:24,389
All I wanted
was to fix my poor Honekoneko!

354
00:20:34,816 --> 00:20:37,152
Die! Troublesome time travel--

355
00:20:37,235 --> 00:20:38,737
Thanks for wait--

356
00:20:40,781 --> 00:20:43,158
I'll never come back.

357
00:20:44,201 --> 00:20:50,207
So basically some shit's gonna go down
if I try and fix Honekoneko right now.

358
00:20:51,750 --> 00:20:55,587
What if we got the person who
made this stuffed fella to fix it up?

359
00:20:55,671 --> 00:20:57,005
We can do that?

360
00:20:57,089 --> 00:20:58,840
You bet we can!

361
00:20:59,633 --> 00:21:01,927
I'm Gunsmith Bitch!

362
00:21:02,260 --> 00:21:06,014
We'll take it to the Pants Dimension.

363
00:21:06,598 --> 00:21:10,143
Bada-bing, bada-boom. We're here!
This is where Honekoneko was made.

364
00:21:10,227 --> 00:21:11,228
Ah, but just FYI.

365
00:21:11,311 --> 00:21:14,940
Time travel's dangerous,
so be careful, okay?

366
00:21:15,023 --> 00:21:18,819
Don't worry. I won't step on anything
or be a troublesome time traveler.

367
00:21:18,902 --> 00:21:22,114
I wonder who made
Honekoneko in the first place--

368
00:21:22,197 --> 00:21:25,367
Huh? Garter made Honekoneko?

369
00:21:25,450 --> 00:21:28,745
Hello, young ladies. How can
Cemetery Hills Church help you today?

370
00:21:29,538 --> 00:21:32,124
Oh my, it seems that poor plushie's
innards have spilled out.

371
00:21:32,207 --> 00:21:33,208
Can you fix my plushie?

372
00:21:33,291 --> 00:21:35,377
That's easy enough.

373
00:21:35,460 --> 00:21:38,588
As it happens, I'm just in the middle
of making a plushie myself.

374
00:21:38,672 --> 00:21:40,882
But I've been hemming and hawing
over what to make.

375
00:21:40,966 --> 00:21:42,342
Why are you making a plushie?

376
00:21:42,426 --> 00:21:44,720
I have two little girls staying with me,

377
00:21:44,803 --> 00:21:47,431
and the little sister
has been feeling homesick.

378
00:21:47,514 --> 00:21:49,808
I thought I'd gift her a little friend
to help cheer her up.

379
00:21:50,392 --> 00:21:52,728
She's never shown much interest
for the cutesy toys

380
00:21:52,811 --> 00:21:54,563
they sell at the department stores,

381
00:21:54,646 --> 00:21:55,689
so I made this one myself.

382
00:21:55,772 --> 00:21:56,773
What's this one's name?

383
00:21:56,857 --> 00:21:58,608
Honekoneko.

384
00:21:58,692 --> 00:22:00,902
And is Honekoneko very important to you?

385
00:22:00,986 --> 00:22:04,489
We're always together. My best friend.

386
00:22:04,573 --> 00:22:05,574
I see.

387
00:22:05,657 --> 00:22:07,325
There you go. All better.

388
00:22:07,409 --> 00:22:09,036
Honekoneko!

389
00:22:09,745 --> 00:22:14,041
I think my own little girl
might like something like Honekoneko too.

390
00:22:14,666 --> 00:22:16,460
Mind if I copy the design?

391
00:22:16,543 --> 00:22:18,795
Sure, go ahead.

392
00:22:18,879 --> 00:22:22,007
But make sure you only
ever hand-wash him, okay?

393
00:22:22,090 --> 00:22:23,508
Handwash? Noted.

394
00:22:26,511 --> 00:22:27,971
Thank you, Garter.

395
00:22:32,768 --> 00:22:37,647
Kill the one who made it,
and Honekoneko will never be born.

396
00:22:37,731 --> 00:22:41,276
I must terminate you
to prevent future crimes!

397
00:22:46,239 --> 00:22:47,866
Who the hell…

398
00:22:48,950 --> 00:22:51,495
All me need is kill.

399
00:22:52,162 --> 00:22:54,831
Now the future is safe.

400
00:23:01,505 --> 00:23:03,215
Well, I'm glad that's over.

401
00:23:03,298 --> 00:23:05,967
I'm pooped. Let's have an early bed time.
What do you say, Honekoneko--

402
00:23:06,885 --> 00:23:09,471
Honeko-- Wait, where are your bones?
Are you just Konekoneko?

403
00:23:09,554 --> 00:23:11,181
Welcome back, Stocking.

404
00:23:14,518 --> 00:23:15,519
Sup.

405
00:23:15,602 --> 00:23:17,604
Oops.

406
00:24:53,450 --> 00:24:55,452
{\an8}Subtitle: Daisy Savage & Rychelle Brittain
